        "chapter": "Look what you can do now",
        "text": "Our goal was to solve and explain everyday fraction problems. Identify the whole, model the relationship, calculate and check the unit. Could you invent a fraction story about your own day? Give it a try, then explore the practice on Math Magic.",
        "role": "recap",
        "equation": null,
